OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells
OL,6,Fwith light showers around to start
OL,7,Fthis evening. Further showers
OL,8,Fdeveloping overnight, especially in
OL,9,Fthe west. Meanwhile, winds easing. A
OL,10,Fchillier night than the last.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA mixed day with scattered
OL,13,Fshowers, but also with plenty of
OL,14,Fsunshine in-between. Showers and winds
OL,15,Feasing later in the afternoon. Feeling
OL,16,Fcooler than on Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
