OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FCloudier
OL,6,Fwith a little rain possible on Sunday.
OL,7,FSome patchy light, drizzly rain
OL,8,Fcontinuing into Monday, then rain
OL,9,Fclearing to brighter skies on Tuesday.
OL,10,FFeeling milder with southerly winds.
